00:00:32.432 --> 00:00:34.000
is a completely different thing.

00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:34.501
It's total

00:00:34.501 --> 00:00:36.069
destruction of infrastructure,

00:00:36.069 --> 00:00:38.738
total destruction of cities and so on.

00:00:38.738 --> 00:00:41.875
We don't do that.

00:00:41.875 --> 00:00:43.710
I mean, this is a whole new level

00:00:43.710 --> 00:00:45.712
spin, gaslighting propaganda.

00:00:45.845 --> 00:00:47.347
I mean, it really is stunning.

00:00:47.347 --> 00:00:49.482
They don't destroy cities

00:00:49.482 --> 00:00:50.183
Look at this before

00:00:50.183 --> 00:00:51.284
and after image,

00:00:51.284 --> 00:00:52.185
Mariupol,

00:00:52.185 --> 00:00:53.253
that once thriving city

00:00:53.253 --> 00:00:54.054
in southern Ukraine

00:00:54.054 --> 00:00:54.554
where

00:00:54.788 --> 00:00:55.922
Russia razed to the ground

00:00:55.922 --> 00:00:57.957
and now occupies

00:00:57.957 --> 00:00:59.793
or look at the charred,

00:00:59.793 --> 00:01:01.261
utterly destroyed,

00:01:01.261 --> 00:01:03.930
