00:01:05.932 --> 00:01:07.534
And then look at it before

00:01:07.534 --> 00:01:09.335
Russia's invasion

00:01:09.335 --> 00:01:11.504
before and after satellite images.

00:01:11.504 --> 00:01:14.107
I mean, to borrow a phrase from

00:01:15.175 --> 00:01:16.276
Peskov.

00:01:16.276 --> 00:01:18.011
Total destruction.

00:01:18.011 --> 00:01:19.412
And as for infrastructure

00:01:19.412 --> 00:01:20.613
targeting Ukrainian power,

00:01:20.613 --> 00:01:21.581
rail and roads, it's

00:01:21.581 --> 00:01:22.816
been a constant in Putin's war.

00:01:22.816 --> 00:01:24.684
Cities in the dark, people in the cold.

00:01:24.684 --> 00:01:26.286
Targeting infrastructure has been a core

00:01:26.286 --> 00:01:27.420
of this whole thing to break

00:01:27.420 --> 00:01:29.489
Ukraine's will Yes, they do that.

00:01:29.489 --> 00:01:30.990
And Pascal's completely

00:01:30.990 --> 00:01:32.258
false claims are coming

00:01:32.258 --> 00:01:33.960
as the head of the brutal private army,

00:01:33.960 --> 00:01:35.595
