00:02:02.388 --> 00:02:04.858
We do major items to which

00:02:05.492 --> 00:02:06.059
you think

00:02:06.059 --> 00:02:08.595
you were the masters of this life.

00:02:08.595 --> 00:02:09.562
Do you think you could

00:02:09.562 --> 00:02:11.965
