00:02:21.741 --> 00:02:22.742
Prigozhin and Vladimir

00:02:22.742 --> 00:02:24.077
Putin's top generals,

00:02:24.077 --> 00:02:26.045
Sergei Shoigu and Bulgari

00:02:26.045 --> 00:02:27.747
