00:02:34.787 --> 00:02:35.588
accusing Russia's

00:02:35.588 --> 00:02:37.290
defense minister of withholding

00:02:37.290 --> 00:02:39.292
much needed ammo You've missed that.

00:02:39.292 --> 00:02:39.726
That was.

00:02:39.726 --> 00:02:40.226
Instead of

00:02:40.226 --> 00:02:42.295
using a shell to kill an enemy

00:02:42.328 --> 00:02:44.831
and saving one of our soldiers lives,

00:02:45.098 --> 00:02:47.333
they are killing our soldiers.

00:02:47.333 --> 00:02:49.269
And this is why you guys are places

00:02:49.269 --> 00:02:49.802
in a country

00:02:49.802 --> 00:02:51.271
