over the past couple of days

00:04:26.866 --> 00:04:27.934
and is saying tonight

00:04:27.934 --> 00:04:28.968
and he did tonight

00:04:28.968 --> 00:04:31.337
come out with another audio message

00:04:31.337 --> 00:04:32.105
where he claimed

00:04:32.105 --> 00:04:33.439
that his mercenaries

00:04:33.439 --> 00:04:35.141
are continuing to move forward

00:04:35.141 --> 00:04:35.742
in Bermuda.

00:04:35.742 --> 00:04:36.943
However, all this comes

00:04:36.943 --> 00:04:38.945
as the commander on the ground tells CNN

00:04:39.078 --> 00:04:40.813
that they've killed hundreds of Russians

00:04:40.813 --> 00:04:42.181
over the past couple of days

00:04:42.181 --> 00:04:44.384
and are advancing in the southwest

00:04:44.550 --> 00:04:46.252
and the northwest of Bermuda.

00:04:46.252 --> 00:04:47.520
So clearly that in-fighting

00:04:47.520 --> 00:04:49.656
already costing the Russians dearly Erin.

