00:05:12.812 --> 00:05:16.082
What do you think is going on here?

00:05:16.416 --> 00:05:18.217
Well, Putin has tolerated

00:05:18.217 --> 00:05:20.553
dissent to his right wing,

00:05:20.553 --> 00:05:22.822
