00:05:59.292 --> 00:06:00.560
You have the Volga group,

00:06:00.560 --> 00:06:01.461
the paramilitary,

00:06:01.461 --> 00:06:03.363
taking orders from Prigozhin.

00:06:03.363 --> 00:06:04.564
