00:06:08.701 --> 00:06:10.269
And then beyond that, I think, Erin,

00:06:10.269 --> 00:06:11.504
you have to look at the Russian

00:06:11.504 --> 00:06:14.574
forces themselves and you conclude

00:06:14.941 --> 00:06:17.710
