00:06:17.910 --> 00:06:18.811
If they ever were,

00:06:18.811 --> 00:06:20.513
they're not well-equipped anymore.

00:06:20.513 --> 00:06:22.382
They've taken enormous casualties

00:06:22.382 --> 00:06:24.350
