00:06:24.350 --> 00:06:26.719
Of armored systems and other material.

00:06:27.420 --> 00:06:29.222
They're not well-led.

00:06:29.222 --> 00:06:29.689
Again, it's

00:06:29.689 --> 00:06:31.290
not a coherent structure

00:06:31.290 --> 00:06:33.559
and they're not well disciplined.

00:06:33.559 --> 00:06:36.629
And by contrast, you see the Ukrainians

00:06:36.629 --> 00:06:37.730
who are going to field

00:06:37.730 --> 00:06:38.498
now as many

00:06:38.498 --> 00:06:41.234
