00:06:51.210 --> 00:06:52.578
Now, for the first time, infantry

00:06:52.578 --> 00:06:54.781
fighting vehicles and other systems.

00:06:54.781 --> 00:06:56.149
They've been training hard,

00:06:56.149 --> 00:06:57.016
they're well-led,

00:06:57.016 --> 00:06:58.017
they're well disciplined,

00:06:58.017 --> 00:06:59.952
they're cohesive units

00:06:59.952 --> 00:07:01.554
as opposed to just battered

00:07:01.554 --> 00:07:03.055
units filled up with individual

00:07:03.055 --> 00:07:03.990
replaced ones.

00:07:03.990 --> 00:07:05.425
So you contrast again

00:07:05.425 --> 00:07:07.693
the Ukrainians with this Russian force.

00:07:07.693 --> 00:07:09.529
And I think we're going to see

00:07:09.529 --> 00:07:10.263
the Ukrainians

00:07:10.263 --> 00:07:12.031
do better than many are assessing

00:07:12.031 --> 00:07:13.666
