And the question is,

00:07:15.902 --> 00:07:16.803
how broad

00:07:16.803 --> 00:07:18.738
is that crumbling or the collapse,

00:07:18.738 --> 00:07:21.040
if you will, and how significant?

00:07:21.240 --> 00:07:22.208
You know, Zelensky today

00:07:22.208 --> 00:07:24.210
said Ukraine needs a bit more time

00:07:24.210 --> 00:07:25.244
to prepare

00:07:25.244 --> 00:07:27.213
to launch the counteroffensive.

00:07:27.213 --> 00:07:28.247
But, you know, the UK now

00:07:28.247 --> 00:07:30.016
says they're providing those longer range

00:07:30.016 --> 00:07:30.950
