00:07:47.700 --> 00:07:49.235
or that the US is not also doing it?

00:07:50.470 --> 00:07:51.237
Well, the UK

00:07:51.237 --> 00:07:51.704
actually has

00:07:51.704 --> 00:07:54.073
led in a number of cases

00:07:54.073 --> 00:07:55.975
really since the very beginning, in fact,

00:07:55.975 --> 00:07:57.210
before the beginning of the war.

00:07:57.210 --> 00:07:59.245
Remember,
they were the first with the man portable

00:07:59.245 --> 00:08:01.147
and I think systems.

00:08:01.147 --> 00:08:02.014
We watched to see

00:08:02.014 --> 00:08:03.082
