were during the attack on TV,

00:09:06.946 --> 00:09:07.847
which means you end up

00:09:07.847 --> 00:09:09.782
with a 40 mile traffic jam

00:09:09.782 --> 00:09:10.917
because the obstacles

00:09:10.917 --> 00:09:12.051
the defensive positions

00:09:12.051 --> 00:09:13.586
naturally do focus

00:09:13.586 --> 00:09:16.055
quite a bit on the major roads.

00:09:16.055 --> 00:09:18.524
During a CNN town hall, the former

00:09:18.524 --> 00:09:19.392
President Trump claimed

00:09:19.392 --> 00:09:20.860
that he could end the war in 24 hours

00:09:20.860 --> 00:09:21.861
if he was president.

00:09:21.861 --> 00:09:22.228
Of course,

00:09:22.228 --> 00:09:23.396
he didn't say whether he wanted

00:09:23.396 --> 00:09:24.697
Ukraine or Russia to win,

00:09:24.697 --> 00:09:25.998
and then said this

00:09:25.998 --> 00:09:26.866
when he was asked

00:09:26.866 --> 00:09:28.200
if he thought Vladimir

00:09:28.200 --> 00:09:29.368
Putin was a war criminal.

00:09:29.368 --> 00:09:30.069
Let me play it for you

00:09:32.138 --> 00:09:33.439
I think it's something that

00:09:33.439 --> 00:09:34.473
should not be discussed

00:09:34.473 --> 00:09:35.808
now, which should be discussed later

00:09:35.808 --> 00:09:37.410
because right now we have to go to war.

00:09:37.410 --> 00:09:38.344
If you say he's a war

00:09:38.344 --> 00:09:39.412
criminal, it's going to be a lot

00:09:39.412 --> 00:09:40.479
tougher to make a deal

00:09:40.479 --> 00:09:42.515
to get this thing stopped.

00:09:43.382 --> 00:09:44.884
The general I picked this portion

00:09:44.884 --> 00:09:47.453
because I know that you have called

00:09:47.453 --> 00:09:48.888
I've labeled Putin war criminal.

00:09:48.888 --> 00:09:50.222
President Biden has labeled Putin

00:09:50.222 --> 00:09:51.223
a war criminal.

00:09:51.223 --> 00:09:53.392
What do you make of Trump's

00:09:53.392 --> 00:09:54.794
refusing to do so, his reasons

00:09:54.794 --> 00:09:56.362
for not doing so?

00:09:56.963 --> 00:09:59.732
Well, again, it's sort of immaterial

00:10:00.232 --> 00:10:01.500
The president of the United States

00:10:01.500 --> 00:10:01.934
and all the

00:10:01.934 --> 00:10:04.036
other major leaders of the Western world

00:10:04.036 --> 00:10:06.138
have labeled Putin the work of let's

00:10:06.138 --> 00:10:07.707
you can't put that back.

00:10:07.707 --> 00:10:10.076
You can't take those words back.

00:10:10.076 --> 00:10:12.378
And beyond that, not only is he

00:10:12.378 --> 00:10:15.481
individually overseen operations that are

00:10:16.616 --> 00:10:17.583
terrible in what

00:10:17.583 --> 00:10:17.917
it is

00:10:17.917 --> 00:10:20.786
that they're doing to innocent civilians

00:10:20.786 --> 00:10:22.021
and violations

00:10:22.021 --> 00:10:23.389
of the law of land warfare,

00:10:23.389 --> 00:10:25.758
Geneva Convention and so forth.

00:10:25.758 --> 00:10:27.860
It's almost as if they propagate

00:10:27.860 --> 00:10:30.363
a culture of committing war crimes.

00:10:30.496 --> 00:10:32.131
General Petraeus, thank you so much.

00:10:32.131 --> 00:10:34.500
I appreciate your time tonight.

00:10:34.667 --> 00:10:35.868
Good to be with you. Thank you.

